      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Keith the owner was great to deal with. I was quite particular in what I wanted and I eventually went with q cell panels and and a solaredge 3phase inverter after several varied quotes and lots of discussion. The install was done on my only day off work to make things easier for me and they were understanding of not letting my dogs out. They turned up on time and the installation was done as planned and very neat and tidy in regards to layout and cable management. Wouldn't hesitate to recommend Prometheus and the guys who installed my system and would happily use them again.",
