      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Being a Solar novice, I asked Solar Quotes for company names for quotes. I asked 4 companies for quotes but ‘Prometheus Energy Solutions’ Beresfield NSW, were the ‘stand out’ company for me.When I first spoke to Keith at Prometheus Energy Solutions, he was very helpful. Over the next couple of weeks, I rang him a few times with questions & ‘what if’s’ & he always answered my questions. Keith’s ‘being there’ & answering all my questions was very important to me. It allowed me to make an informed decision, a decision I’m very happy with.Once the decision was made, installation moved quickly even though we had rain. The installers arrived on time, were very efficient, tidy & polite. The panels look great on the roof & are working very efficiently.Keith organised the connection to the grid & I’m expecting that to be completed within a week.I have no hesitation in recommending Prometheus Energy Solutions to anyone who requires quality service, quality products & quality installation.",
